  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></munderover><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Then,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></munderover><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></munderover><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>j</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math>, then we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Put <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math>, then we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Solving <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>)</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Hence,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></munderover><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></munderover><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>j</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>"
  }
